     "body": "<p>Suggestions made on #fcrepo IRC to make use of `Prefer: return=representation; include=\"<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#InboundReferences\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#InboundReferences</a>\"` and to have a flag to import-export that says \"traverse via these predicates, and use prefer headers to get the inbound relationships\".</p>",
     "created": "17/May/17 6:02 PM",
